{"title":"OpenClaw系列教程（01）- OpenClaw是什么？5分钟安装和架构概览","uid":"6988ace49bc9e4e76faa5877017c2a8c","slug":"openclaw-tutorial-day-01","date":"2026-07-21T10:52:00.000Z","updated":"2026-07-23T01:14:50.384Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/openclaw-tutorial-day-01.json","keywords":null,"cover":null,"content":"<blockquote><span class=\"custom-blockquote-svg\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-reactroot=\"\">\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M22 12C22 6.5 17.5 2 12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12C2 17.5 6.5 22 12 22C13.8 22 15.5 21.5 17 20.6L22 22L20.7 17C21.5 15.5 22 13.8 22 12Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M17 8.5C15.23 8.97 14.07 10.84 14.01 13.27C14 13.33 14 13.4 14 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M9 8.5C7.23 8.97 6.07 10.84 6.01 13.27C6 13.33 6 13.4 6 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n</span><p>🎯 学习目标：理解OpenClaw的核心概念，完成安装，运行第一个AI助手</p></blockquote>\n<h1 id=\"什么是OpenClaw？\"><a href=\"#什么是OpenClaw？\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"什么是OpenClaw？\"></a>什么是OpenClaw？</h1><p>OpenClaw是一个<strong>自托管的AI Agent网关</strong>，它把你的各种聊天工具（WhatsApp、Telegram、Discord、Signal、Slack、iMessage等30+渠道）连接到AI模型（Claude、GPT、Gemini等）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心特性\"><a href=\"#核心特性\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"核心特性\"></a>核心特性</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>🔒 自托管</strong> - 数据完全在你自己的机器上，隐私优先</li>\n<li><strong>📱 多渠道统一</strong> - 一个Agent服务所有聊天平台</li>\n<li><strong>🧠 持久记忆</strong> - 基于文件的记忆系统，完全可检查</li>\n<li><strong>🔧 工具丰富</strong> - 浏览器控制、代码执行、网页搜索、技能系统</li>\n<li><strong>⚡ 实时响应</strong> - WebSocket优先的流式架构</li>\n<li><strong>🛡️ 安全设计</strong> - 沙箱隔离、工具策略、MITRE ATLAS威胁建模</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"谁在用OpenClaw？\"><a href=\"#谁在用OpenClaw？\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"谁在用OpenClaw？\"></a>谁在用OpenClaw？</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>个人开发者</strong> - 打造私人AI助手，管理日程、邮件、任务</li>\n<li><strong>团队</strong> - 在Discord&#x2F;Slack&#x2F;Teams中集成AI协作</li>\n<li><strong>企业</strong> - 私有化部署，数据安全合规</li>\n<li><strong>AI研究者</strong> - 探索Agent能力边界</li>\n</ul>\n<h1 id=\"架构概览\"><a href=\"#架构概览\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"架构概览\"></a>架构概览</h1><figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐</span><br><span class=\"line\">│                      你的机器                           │</span><br><span class=\"line\">│  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────┐  │</span><br><span class=\"line\">│  │              OpenClaw Gateway                    │  │</span><br><span class=\"line\">│  │  ┌─────────────┐  ┌──────────────┐  ┌────────┐  │  │</span><br><span class=\"line\">│  │  │   Agent     │  │   Session    │  │  Tools │  │  │</span><br><span class=\"line\">│  │  │   Runtime   │  │   Manager    │  │  Engine│  │  │</span><br><span class=\"line\">│  │  └─────────────┘  └──────────────┘  └────────┘  │  │</span><br><span class=\"line\">│  │  ┌─────────────┐  ┌──────────────┐  ┌────────┐  │  │</span><br><span class=\"line\">│  │  │   Memory    │  │   Context    │  │  Skills│  │  │</span><br><span class=\"line\">│  │  │   System    │  │   Engine     │  │        │  │  │</span><br><span class=\"line\">│  │  └─────────────┘  └──────────────┘  └────────┘  │  │</span><br><span class=\"line\">│  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────┘  │</span><br><span class=\"line\">│                          │                              │</span><br><span class=\"line\">│          WebSocket API (端口 18789)                     │</span><br><span class=\"line\">│                          │                              │</span><br><span class=\"line\">└──────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────┘</span><br><span class=\"line\">                           │</span><br><span class=\"line\">        ┌──────────────────┼──────────────────┐</span><br><span class=\"line\">        │                  │                  │</span><br><span class=\"line\">   ┌────▼────┐        ┌────▼────┐        ┌────▼────┐</span><br><span class=\"line\">   │WhatsApp │        │Telegram │        │ Discord │</span><br><span class=\"line\">   │ (Baileys)│       │ (grammY)│        │  (d.js) │</span><br><span class=\"line\">   └─────────┘        └─────────┘        └─────────┘</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h2 id=\"核心组件\"><a href=\"#核心组件\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"核心组件\"></a>核心组件</h2><p><strong>Gateway（网关）</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>整个系统的核心守护进程</li>\n<li>管理所有渠道连接</li>\n<li>处理Agent运行时和会话</li>\n<li>提供WebSocket API供客户端连接</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Agent Runtime（Agent运行时）</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>执行AI推理循环</li>\n<li>管理工具调用</li>\n<li>处理上下文和记忆</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Session Manager（会话管理器）</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>路由消息到正确的会话</li>\n<li>管理会话生命周期</li>\n<li>支持DM隔离和群组隔离</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Tools Engine（工具引擎）</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>提供浏览器控制、代码执行、网页搜索等能力</li>\n<li>支持技能系统扩展</li>\n<li>沙箱安全隔离</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Memory System（记忆系统）</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>基于文件的持久化记忆</li>\n<li>支持语义搜索</li>\n<li>自动记忆刷新和整合</li>\n</ul>\n<h1 id=\"5分钟快速安装\"><a href=\"#5分钟快速安装\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5分钟快速安装\"></a>5分钟快速安装</h1><h2 id=\"前置要求\"><a href=\"#前置要求\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"前置要求\"></a>前置要求</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Node.js</strong>: 22.22.3+ &#x2F; 24.15+ &#x2F; 25.9+（推荐24）</li>\n<li><strong>操作系统</strong>: macOS、Linux或Windows</li>\n<li><strong>AI模型API Key</strong>: Anthropic、OpenAI或Google的API Key</li>\n</ul>\n<p>检查Node版本：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">node --version</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 应该显示 v22.x.x、v24.x.x 或 v25.x.x</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h2 id=\"安装步骤\"><a href=\"#安装步骤\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"安装步骤\"></a>安装步骤</h2><h3 id=\"方法1：一键安装脚本（推荐）\"><a href=\"#方法1：一键安装脚本（推荐）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"方法1：一键安装脚本（推荐）\"></a>方法1：一键安装脚本（推荐）</h3><p>这是最简单的方式，脚本会自动检测系统、安装Node（如果需要）、安装OpenClaw并启动引导。</p>\n<p><strong>macOS &#x2F; Linux &#x2F; WSL2：</strong></p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">curl -fsSL https://openclaw.ai/install.sh | bash</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p><strong>Windows PowerShell：</strong></p>\n<figure class=\"highlight powershell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">iwr</span> <span class=\"literal\">-useb</span> https://openclaw.ai/install.ps1 | <span class=\"built_in\">iex</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"方法2：手动安装\"><a href=\"#方法2：手动安装\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"方法2：手动安装\"></a>方法2：手动安装</h3><p>如果你已经有Node环境，可以手动安装：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 使用npm</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">npm install -g openclaw@latest</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 或使用pnpm</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">pnpm add -g openclaw@latest</span><br><span class=\"line\">pnpm approve-builds -g</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 或使用bun</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">bun add -g openclaw@latest</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"方法3：从源码安装\"><a href=\"#方法3：从源码安装\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"方法3：从源码安装\"></a>方法3：从源码安装</h3><p>适合开发者或想运行最新代码的人：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">git <span class=\"built_in\">clone</span> https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw.git</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">cd</span> openclaw</span><br><span class=\"line\">pnpm install &amp;&amp; pnpm build &amp;&amp; pnpm ui:build</span><br><span class=\"line\">pnpm <span class=\"built_in\">link</span> --global</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h2 id=\"运行引导向导\"><a href=\"#运行引导向导\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"运行引导向导\"></a>运行引导向导</h2><p>安装完成后，运行引导向导完成初始配置：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">openclaw onboard --install-daemon</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>向导会引导你完成：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>选择AI模型提供商（Anthropic&#x2F;OpenAI&#x2F;Google等）</li>\n<li>配置API Key</li>\n<li>设置Gateway认证方式</li>\n<li>安装守护进程（开机自启）</li>\n<li>创建Agent工作区</li>\n</ol>\n<p>整个过程通常只需几分钟。</p>\n<h2 id=\"验证安装\"><a href=\"#验证安装\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"验证安装\"></a>验证安装</h2><p>安装完成后，验证一切正常：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 检查版本</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">openclaw --version</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 检查配置问题</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">openclaw doctor</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 查看Gateway状态</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">openclaw gateway status</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 打开控制面板</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">openclaw dashboard</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>如果<code>openclaw dashboard</code>能在浏览器中打开控制面板，说明安装成功！</p>\n<h1 id=\"第一次对话\"><a href=\"#第一次对话\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"第一次对话\"></a>第一次对话</h1><p>打开控制面板后，你会看到一个聊天界面。直接输入消息，就能和你的AI助手对话了：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">你：你好！介绍一下你自己</span><br><span class=\"line\">AI：你好！我是你的AI助手，运行在OpenClaw上...</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h1 id=\"文件结构概览\"><a href=\"#文件结构概览\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"文件结构概览\"></a>文件结构概览</h1><p>安装完成后，你的系统会有这些关键目录：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">~/.openclaw/                          # OpenClaw主目录</span><br><span class=\"line\">├── openclaw.json                     # 主配置文件</span><br><span class=\"line\">├── workspace/                        # Agent工作区（默认）</span><br><span class=\"line\">│   ├── AGENTS.md                     # Agent操作指南</span><br><span class=\"line\">│   ├── SOUL.md                       # 人格和语气</span><br><span class=\"line\">│   ├── USER.md                       # 用户信息</span><br><span class=\"line\">│   ├── IDENTITY.md                   # Agent身份</span><br><span class=\"line\">│   ├── TOOLS.md                      # 工具使用指南</span><br><span class=\"line\">│   ├── HEARTBEAT.md                  # 心跳检查清单</span><br><span class=\"line\">│   ├── MEMORY.md                     # 长期记忆（可选）</span><br><span class=\"line\">│   └── memory/                       # 每日记忆</span><br><span class=\"line\">│       └── YYYY-MM-DD.md</span><br><span class=\"line\">├── agents/                           # Agent数据</span><br><span class=\"line\">│   └── &lt;agent-id&gt;/</span><br><span class=\"line\">│       ├── sessions/                 # 会话记录</span><br><span class=\"line\">│       └── agent/                    # Agent配置</span><br><span class=\"line\">└── credentials/                      # 渠道凭证</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p><strong>重要概念：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>workspace/</code> 是Agent的”家”，包含所有记忆和配置</li>\n<li><code>openclaw.json</code> 是系统配置，不要手动编辑（用<code>openclaw configure</code>）</li>\n<li>会话记录在<code>sessions/</code>，是JSONL格式的对话历史</li>\n</ul>\n<h1 id=\"下一步\"><a href=\"#下一步\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"下一步\"></a>下一步</h1><p>恭喜你完成了安装！明天我们将深入探讨OpenClaw的核心概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Day 02</strong>：核心概念 - Agent、Session、Workspace的深入理解</li>\n<li>了解消息如何路由到不同的会话</li>\n<li>工作区文件的作用和如何定制</li>\n<li>会话的生命周期和管理</li>\n</ul>\n<h1 id=\"常见问题\"><a href=\"#常见问题\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"常见问题\"></a>常见问题</h1><p><strong>Q: 安装脚本需要什么权限？</strong><br>A: 脚本会安装Node.js（如果缺少）和OpenClaw。在Linux上可能需要sudo权限来安装系统级依赖。</p>\n<p><strong>Q: 可以用多个AI提供商吗？</strong><br>A: 可以！OpenClaw支持配置多个模型提供商，并在它们之间故障转移。我们Day 03会详细讲解。</p>\n<p><strong>Q: 数据安全吗？</strong><br>A: OpenClaw是自托管的，所有数据都在你的机器上。记忆系统基于纯文本文件，完全可检查。没有隐藏的云端同步。</p>\n<p><strong>Q: 支持哪些AI模型？</strong><br>A: 支持所有主流模型：Claude（Anthropic）、GPT-4（OpenAI）、Gemini（Google）、本地模型（Ollama）等。</p>\n<p><strong>Q: 可以在VPS上运行吗？</strong><br>A: 可以！OpenClaw支持Docker部署、VPS部署，也支持Tailscale远程访问。Day 27会详细讲解远程部署。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>📚 参考资料</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.openclaw.ai/start/getting-started\">官方文档 - 快速开始</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.openclaw.ai/install\">官方文档 - 安装</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw\">GitHub仓库</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>⏭️ 下一篇：<a href=\"/2026/07/22/openclaw-tutorial-day-02/\">Day 02 - 核心概念：Agent、Session、Workspace</a></strong></p>\n","text":" 🎯 学习目标：理解OpenClaw的核心概念，完成安装，运行第一个AI助手 什么是OpenClaw？OpenClaw是一个自托管的AI Agent网关，它把你...","permalink":"/post/openclaw-tutorial-day-01","photos":[],"count_time":{"symbolsCount":"4.8k","symbolsTime":"4 mins."},"categories":[{"name":"AI","slug":"AI","count":4,"path":"api/categories/AI.json"},{"name":"技术教程","slug":"AI/技术教程","count":4,"path":"api/categories/AI/技术教程.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"OpenClaw","slug":"OpenClaw","count":6,"path":"api/tags/OpenClaw.json"},{"name":"教程","slug":"教程","count":5,"path":"api/tags/教程.json"},{"name":"AI Agent","slug":"AI-Agent","count":5,"path":"api/tags/AI-Agent.json"}],"toc":"<ol class=\"toc\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-1\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E6%98%AFOpenClaw%EF%BC%9F\"><span class=\"toc-text\">什么是OpenClaw？</span></a><ol class=\"toc-child\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7\"><span class=\"toc-text\">核心特性</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E8%B0%81%E5%9C%A8%E7%94%A8OpenClaw%EF%BC%9F\"><span class=\"toc-text\">谁在用OpenClaw？</span></a></li></ol></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-1\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E6%9E%B6%E6%9E%84%E6%A6%82%E8%A7%88\"><span class=\"toc-text\">架构概览</span></a><ol class=\"toc-child\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E7%BB%84%E4%BB%B6\"><span class=\"toc-text\">核心组件</span></a></li></ol></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-1\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#5%E5%88%86%E9%92%9F%E5%BF%AB%E9%80%9F%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%